{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, Cat, are the son of a cat named Meow. You know nothing else. You have lost your memory. Waking up in a mysterious castle, you are trying to get out and remember your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to control, which will allow any, even the smallest, players to easily understand. You will find many levels filled with treasures, but to get them, you will have to go through puzzles, tricky enemies and traps that are hidden around every corner! This game does not have annoying ads, donations and hidden purchases. A more developed world and rethought gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports various control scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard:<br>Pause - ESC, Tab, I<br>Movement - WASD or arrows<br>Action - F, Space, Enter<br>Shield - Shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse:<br>Scroll through levels in the main menu - use the mouse wheel.<br>Movement - Hold the left mouse button and drag to jump in the desired direction.<br>Action - Right mouse button.<br>Shield - Middle mouse button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad on Xbox example:<br>Scroll levels in the main menu - use the right stick.<br>Pause - Left center button.<br>Movement - Use the left stick or arrows.<br>Action - A, X.<br>Shield - Y, B.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010910?t=1768049939","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010910/8ef747c43b82e125be6f5927f1954e962da2c87f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768049939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010910/5c4ee29e58499fb5272334ca538ced5ddb2e8613/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768049939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010910/5c4ee29e58499fb5272334ca538ced5ddb2e8613/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768049939","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"